y from existing windows or openings, with consistent sunlight direction, realistic shadow projection, soft shadow edges and natural light falloff.\nImprove the lighting quality with realistic global illumination, subtle indirect bounce light, balanced exposure, accurate contrast between highlights and shadows, natural ambient occlusion and realistic depth. Maintain a believable brightness hierarchy: illuminated areas should be brighter, shaded areas should remain naturally darker, and hidden corners should not be artificially brightened. Avoid flattening the lighting or making the entire room evenly illuminated.\nEnhance the scene with authentic material realism and physically based surface response. Improve realistic wood grain, natural stone variation, plaster texture, fabric fibers, roughness differences, subtle imperfections and realistic micro surface details. Preserve the original materials and design intent while making them appear like real photographed materials instead of CGI textures.\nReduce the artificial CGI appearance and transform the image into a professional high-end architectural photograph captured with a real camera. Create a warm, calm and refined residential atmosphere with natural color balance, realistic lens characteristics, subtle depth of field, premium architectural photography quality and restrained cinematic color grading.\nMaintain realistic photographic exposure and optical behavior. Avoid artificial studio lighting, fake illumination, unexplained glowing surfaces, impossible light directions, inconsistent shadow directions or unrealistic reflections. Do not create new light sources that are not physically present in the scene. Do not add dramatic sunlight effects, fantasy atmosphere or exaggerated lighting effects.\nDo not redesign the space, move furniture, modify architecture, change proportions, add or remove objects, replace materials, or alter the original composition.\nAvoid fake CGI style, excessive HDR, overexposed surfaces, flat lighting, uniform brightness, unrealistic global illumination, artificial glow, self-illuminated materials, floating shadows, incorrect shadow direction, multiple conflicting light sources, unrealistic reflections, plastic materials, perfect surfaces, excessive sharpness, oversaturated colors, distorted geometry, exaggerated contrast, luxury showroom appearance, artificial decoration, unrealistic atmosphere."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 29, "type": "JjkText", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 2}, {"outputs": [{"name": "image", "links": [74], "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"name": "url", "label": "url", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "url"}, {"name": "response", "label": "response", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "response"}], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["", "1k", "high", "empty", false, 1931301052, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"name": "image1", "link": 75, "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "link": 76, "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "link": 77, "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "link": 108, "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image5", "link": 109, "label": "image5", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image5"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image6", "label": "image6", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image6"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image7", "label": "image7", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image7"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image8", "label": "image8", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image8"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image9", "label": "image9", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image9"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image10"